'''''Philodendron campii''''' is a species of flowering plant in the family [[Araceae]], native to Colombia, Ecuador, and Peru, and to adjoining parts of Brazil.<ref name="POWO_60435393-2" >{{cite POWO |id=60435393-2 |title=''Philodendron campii'' Croat |access-date=30 April 2025 }}</ref> It is found in wet tropical forests, and it is available from commercial growers as a houseplant.<ref name="POWO_60435393-2" /><ref name="Conservatory" >{{cite web |url=https://conservatoryarchives.co.uk/products/philodendron-campii-lynette |title=''Philodendron campii'' 'Lynette' |author=<!--Not stated--> |date=2025 |website=conservatoryarchives.co.uk |publisher=Conservatory Archives |access-date=30 April 2025 |archive-date=30 April 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250430165558/https://conservatoryarchives.co.uk/products/philodendron-campii-lynette |url-status=live }}</ref>

